1
00:00:00,220 --> 00:00:01,486
Welcome to CateringMS.

2
00:00:01,486 --> 00:00:08,662
This walkthrough follows Cedar and Sage Catering as it
prepares a new workspace for its first quote.

3
00:00:09,620 --> 00:00:13,463
Under Business, confirm the company name and contact
email.

4
00:00:13,463 --> 00:00:20,722
Add your legal or trading name and any registration
details you want to include on business documents.

5
00:00:20,722 --> 00:00:22,431
Select Save and continue.

6
00:00:23,387 --> 00:00:26,738
Enter the address your team dispatches from.

7
00:00:26,738 --> 00:00:32,004
CateringMS uses this location to calculate delivery
distances and plan routes.

8
00:00:32,004 --> 00:00:34,397
Check the address before saving.

9
00:00:35,353 --> 00:00:37,402
Choose your primary and secondary colours.

10
00:00:37,402 --> 00:00:43,206
Use the preview to check how they look, and add your
company logo for the customer portal.

11
00:00:44,153 --> 00:00:48,446
If you accept bank transfers, enter your business banking
details.

12
00:00:48,446 --> 00:00:54,027
Customers who choose EFT will see the payment instructions
and the invoice reference.

13
00:00:54,987 --> 00:00:58,415
To accept online payments, connect your company's payment
provider.

14
00:00:58,415 --> 00:01:05,271
If your account is still being set up, select Skip for now
and return to this step later.

15
00:01:06,220 --> 00:01:09,480
Confirm whether your business is registered for VAT.

16
00:01:09,480 --> 00:01:12,739
This setting determines the heading on your invoices.

17
00:01:12,739 --> 00:01:15,999
If you are registered, enter your VAT number.

18
00:01:16,953 --> 00:01:20,396
Choose the address your quotes and invoices are sent from.

19
00:01:20,396 --> 00:01:25,216
You can use the shared CateringMS sender while your own
domain is being verified.

20
00:01:26,153 --> 00:01:29,272
Select the events you want to receive alerts for.

21
00:01:29,272 --> 00:01:34,469
Enable push notifications on each phone or tablet where
you want those alerts to appear.

22
00:01:35,420 --> 00:01:40,033
Set when payment is due, and decide whether to send a
payment reminder.

23
00:01:40,033 --> 00:01:43,936
Review which other customer emails should go out
automatically before saving.

24
00:01:44,887 --> 00:01:50,693
If you already have a client list, use the bulk import to
bring those contacts into CateringMS.

25
00:01:50,693 --> 00:01:54,792
If you are starting fresh, you can add clients as you go.

26
00:01:55,753 --> 00:01:59,810
Review your setup, then select Finish setup and go to
dashboard.

27
00:01:59,810 --> 00:02:05,711
You can return to Settings later to make changes or
connect optional services such as WhatsApp.

28
00:02:06,653 --> 00:02:11,935
From the dashboard, use the checklist to invite your team
and add your menu and prices.

29
00:02:11,935 --> 00:02:15,895
Once those are in place, you can start preparing your
first quote.
